      "content": "# Run #3: 1x1 Slots Running Low\n\nHi @everyone, we're down to our last couple full-sized slots, so this is the moment to secure your space before they're all gone! Don't worry, there are plenty of half and quarter-sized slots still available, but if you need all the silicon you can get, now is the time to get it.\n\nBuy now: [crowdsupply.com/wafer-space/gf180mcu-run-3](<https://www.crowdsupply.com/wafer-space/gf180mcu-run-3#products>)\n\nThanks for all your support, and happy building :waferspace:",
