      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "# Run #3: Early Bird Deadline + 1x1 Slots Gone!\n\nAll of our full-sized slots are gone! Thank you @everyone for supporting us :waferspace: ❤️ \n\nPlenty of half and quarter-sized slots are still up for grabs, so there is still a chance to join Run #3 if you haven't already. Speaking of which...\n\n**Early bird pricing ends in a week!** You have until **30 September 2026 23:59 AoE** to lock in the discounted price ($2/die for the quarter slot and $4/die for the half slots) and save money on your next tape out. Don't wait until the very last minute - they might be gone by then!\n\nGet your slot here: [crowdsupply.com/wafer-space/gf180mcu-run-3](<https://www.crowdsupply.com/wafer-space/gf180mcu-run-3/#products>)",
